SixIsland_AlteringCave_Text_MadokaIntro::
	.string "Oh... a challenger.\n"
	.string "I'm Kaname Madoka.\p"
	.string "A white creature once offered\n"
	.string "to grant me any wish I wanted.\p"
	.string "I refused. I saw what it\n"
	.string "cost the girls who accepted.\p"
	.string "And now you've come to me,\n"
	.string "carrying a wish of your own.\p"
	.string "Every wish has a price.\n"
	.string "Are you ready to pay for yours?$"

SixIsland_AlteringCave_Text_MadokaRefuse::
	.string "Oh... you're not ready?\n"
	.string "That's okay. Rushing into\l"
	.string "a decision never ends well.\p"
	.string "Think it over carefully,\n"
	.string "and read the fine print this time.\p"
	.string "Come back when your Soul Gem...\n"
	.string "I mean, your heart, is ready.$"

SixIsland_AlteringCave_Text_MadokaVictory::
	.string "...It's over.\n"
	.string "Your wish wasn't strong enough.\p"
	.string "This is the price. Everyone\n"
	.string "who loses hope pays it in the end.\p"
	.string "Don't look at me like that.\n"
	.string "I warned you about the cost.$"

SixIsland_AlteringCave_Text_MadokaPostBattle::
	.string "Sayaka always said that\n"
	.string "a wish should be for others.\p"
	.string "I think that's what makes\n"
	.string "a team strong. They fight for you,\l"
	.string "and you fight for them.\p"
	.string "Please take care of\n"
	.string "your Pokémon.\p"
	.string "And if a strange white creature\n"
	.string "offers you a deal... say no!$"
